Source: garrett
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: sentinels <noreply@sentinels.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/gary23w/sentinels
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: garrett
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, iproute2
Recommends: nftables
Description: sentinels agent: host intrusion sentinel that stops what it catches
 garrett, the agent of sentinels, watches this machine's running programs and
 their connections, scores them on the machine, and pauses or ends a program
 it judges hostile.
 .
 It reports cases to a Sentinel service you run yourself, applies what that
 service learned from earlier attacks, and shares what one machine learns
 with the rest of your machines.

Package: sentinels
Architecture: all
Section: metapackages
Depends: garrett (>= ${source:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: sentinels host intrusion detection and response (installs garrett)
 sentinels is open-source host intrusion detection and response. Its agent,
 garrett, watches this machine's running programs and their connections and
 ends a program it judges hostile.
 .
 This package installs garrett, which does the work: remove garrett to remove
 both.
